{% comment %}
  Gifting banner - the photograph on one side, the invitation to shop it on the other.

  The band is one full-bleed photograph with a panel of content held over its empty half: a
  small heading, the heading proper, a line of copy, up to four products from a collection and
  one button. The photography (assets/gifting-perfect-gift.jpg) carries the gift box and the
  rings across its left-hand side and leaves the marble clear on the right, so the content sits
  on the right by default and "Content side" flips it for a picture shot the other way round.

  Below 990px the picture stops being a background and goes on top at its own height, with the
  content underneath it on the section's background colour. The band stacks there rather than at
  the theme's usual 750px because the empty half of a 3:1 photograph is not wide enough to hold
  a row of product cards on a tablet: the text ends up over the gift box. The smaller picture is
  its own file (a left-hand crop of the same shot), so the box and the rings fill the frame once
  the empty half is no longer needed.

  Buttons come from assets/eden-actions.css, which names .gifting-banner__button in the one
  call-to-action family and owns the hover for all of them; this section only says which two
  colours the shared sweep crosses between.

  Every restylable setting is written onto the section element as a CSS custom property, with
  the stylesheet's own value as the fallback, so a setting left at "use the default" (a cleared
  colour, a size of 0) writes nothing at all.
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign transparent = 'rgba(0,0,0,0)'

  assign gifting_collection = section.settings.collection | default: collections['best-sellers']

  assign image = section.settings.image
  assign desktop_asset = 'gifting-perfect-gift.jpg'
  assign mobile_asset = 'gifting-perfect-gift-mobile.jpg'

  comment
    The small screens take the mobile picture if one was picked, and the desktop picture if one
    was picked and the mobile one was not - a shop that swaps the photograph in the editor and
    sets only the one field should not be left with the old crop on a phone. Only when neither
    is picked does it fall back to this theme's own cropped file.
  endcomment
  assign mobile_image = section.settings.mobile_image | default: image

  comment
    A template saved before a setting existed has no value for it, so sizes are coerced with
    'plus: 0' and treated as "keep the stylesheet default" at 0. The paddings cannot use that
    sentinel - 0 is a real padding - and are gated by their own checkbox instead.
  endcomment
  assign heading_size = section.settings.heading_size | plus: 0
  assign heading_size_mobile = section.settings.heading_size_mobile | plus: 0
  assign heading_tracking = section.settings.heading_tracking | plus: 0
  assign eyebrow_size = section.settings.eyebrow_size | plus: 0
  assign text_size = section.settings.text_size | plus: 0
  assign card_text_size = section.settings.card_text_size | plus: 0
  assign band_height = section.settings.band_height | plus: 0
  assign content_share = section.settings.content_share | plus: 0
  assign measure = section.settings.text_measure | plus: 0

  comment
    Two different numbers, which used to be one.

    "columns" is how many cards the panel shows at a time - as many as fit
    across it without becoming thumbnails, which on a panel this narrow is
    three. "product_count" is how many are in the row altogether. The row used
    to stop at the first of those, so the section could never offer more than
    four gifts; now anything past the visible three scrolls.

    A template saved before the second setting existed has no value for it, so
    it falls back to the visible count and the row behaves exactly as it did.
  endcomment
  assign columns = section.settings.columns | plus: 0
  if columns <= 0
    assign columns = 3
  endif
  assign columns_mobile = section.settings.columns_mobile | plus: 0
  if columns_mobile <= 0
    assign columns_mobile = 2
  endif

  assign product_count = section.settings.product_count | plus: 0
  if product_count < columns
    assign product_count = columns
  endif

  comment
    The focal point is a real percentage, so 0 means "the left edge", not "use the default"; it
    falls back only when the template predates the setting. The shot is framed left, so the
    default pins the crop to the left edge rather than the centre.
  endcomment
  assign focal_x = section.settings.focal_x | default: 0
  assign focal_y = section.settings.focal_y | default: 50

  assign button_label = section.settings.button_label | strip
  assign button_link = section.settings.button_link | default: gifting_collection.url
-%}

{%- capture section_styles -%}
  {%- if section.settings.section_background != blank and section.settings.section_background != transparent -%}--gift-section-bg: {{ section.settings.section_background }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.heading_color != blank and section.settings.heading_color != transparent -%}--gift-heading-color: {{ section.settings.heading_color }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.eyebrow_color != blank and section.settings.eyebrow_color != transparent -%}--gift-eyebrow-color: {{ section.settings.eyebrow_color }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.text_color != blank and section.settings.text_color != transparent -%}--gift-text-color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.card_background != blank -%}--gift-card-bg: {{ section.settings.card_background }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.card_text_color != blank and section.settings.card_text_color != transparent -%}--gift-card-color: {{ section.settings.card_text_color }};{%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    The three pairs the shared sweep in eden-actions.css crosses between: what the button looks
    like at rest, and what it looks like hovered. Nothing here writes a :hover of its own.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if section.settings.button_background != blank and section.settings.button_background != transparent -%}--gift-button-fill: {{ section.settings.button_background }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.button_text_color != blank and section.settings.button_text_color != transparent -%}--gift-button-ink: {{ section.settings.button_text_color }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.button_border_color != blank and section.settings.button_border_color != transparent -%}--gift-button-edge: {{ section.settings.button_border_color }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.button_background_hover != blank and section.settings.button_background_hover != transparent -%}--gift-button-fill-hover: {{ section.settings.button_background_hover }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if section.settings.button_text_color_hover != blank and section.settings.button_text_color_hover != transparent -%}--gift-button-ink-hover: {{ section.settings.button_text_color_hover }};{%- endif -%}

  {%- if heading_size > 0 -%}--gift-heading-size: {{ heading_size }}px;{%- endif -%}
  {%- if heading_size_mobile > 0 -%}--gift-heading-size-mobile: {{ heading_size_mobile }}px;{%- endif -%}
  {%- if heading_tracking > 0 -%}--gift-heading-tracking: {{ heading_tracking | divided_by: 100.0 }}em;{%- endif -%}
  {%- unless section.settings.uppercase_heading -%}--gift-heading-case: none;{%- endunless -%}
  {%- if eyebrow_size > 0 -%}--gift-eyebrow-size: {{ eyebrow_size }}px;{%- endif -%}
  {%- if text_size > 0 -%}--gift-text-size: {{ text_size }}px;{%- endif -%}
  {%- if card_text_size > 0 -%}--gift-card-text-size: {{ card_text_size }}px;{%- endif -%}
  {%- if measure > 0 -%}--gift-measure: {{ measure }}ch;{%- endif -%}

  {%- if band_height > 0 -%}--gift-band-height: {{ band_height }}px;{%- endif -%}
  {%- if content_share > 0 -%}--gift-content-share: {{ content_share }}%;{%- endif -%}
  --gift-focal-x: {{ focal_x }}%;
  --gift-focal-y: {{ focal_y }}%;
  --gift-scrim: {{ section.settings.scrim_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
  {%- comment -%}
    How many cards are on screen at once. The track sizes its own columns from
    these, so the cards keep their width as the row scrolls instead of being
    divided up between however many products the collection happens to hold.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  --gift-visible: {{ columns }};
  --gift-visible-mobile: {{ columns_mobile }};

  --gift-inset: {{ section.settings.side_spacing | default: 0 }}px;
  --gift-inset-mobile: {{ section.settings.side_spacing_mobile | default: 0 }}px;

  {%- if section.settings.custom_padding -%}
    --gift-pad-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;
    --gift-pad-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    --gift-pad-top-mobile: {{ section.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px;
    --gift-pad-bottom-mobile: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- comment -%}
  The row of gifts scrolls, and its arrows live in a custom element in assets/
  rather than a script here: the theme editor swaps a section's HTML in by
  assignment, which never runs an inline script, so the arrows would stop
  working the moment a setting was changed.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script src="{{ 'gifting-scroller.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

<section
  id="eden-quote-{{ section.id }}"
  class="eden-quote force-full-width eden-quote--content-{{ section.settings.content_side }} eden-quote--{{ section.settings.text_alignment }} eden-quote--button-{{ section.settings.button_alignment | default: 'center' }}"
  style="{{ section_styles | strip_newlines | strip }}"
  {{ section.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="gifting-banner__media">
    <picture>
      {%- if mobile_image != blank -%}
        <source
          media="(max-width: 989px)"
          srcset="
            {{ mobile_image | image_url: width: 750 }} 750w,
            {{ mobile_image | image_url: width: 1100 }} 1100w,
            {{ mobile_image | image_url: width: 1400 }} 1400w
          "
          sizes="100vw"
        >
      {%- else -%}
        <source
          media="(max-width: 989px)"
          srcset="
            {% render 'image-source', file: mobile_asset, width: 750 %} 750w,
            {% render 'image-source', file: mobile_asset, width: 1100 %} 1100w,
            {% render 'image-source', file: mobile_asset, width: 1400 %} 1400w
          "
          sizes="100vw"
        >
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if image != blank -%}
        {{
          image
          | image_url: width: 2400
          | image_tag:
            loading: 'lazy',
            widths: '750, 1100, 1500, 1800, 2200, 2400',
            sizes: '100vw',
            alt: '',
            class: 'gifting-banner__background'
        }}
      {%- else -%}
        <img
          class="gifting-banner__background"
          src="{% render 'image-source', file: desktop_asset, width: 2172 %}"
          srcset="
            {% render 'image-source', file: desktop_asset, width: 750 %} 750w,
            {% render 'image-source', file: desktop_asset, width: 1100 %} 1100w,
            {% render 'image-source', file: desktop_asset, width: 1500 %} 1500w,
            {% render 'image-source', file: desktop_asset, width: 1800 %} 1800w,
            {% render 'image-source', file: desktop_asset, width: 2172 %} 2172w
          "
          sizes="100vw"
          alt=""
          loading="lazy"
          width="2172"
          height="724"
        >
      {%- endif -%}
    </picture>
  </div>

  <div class="gifting-banner__content">
    {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
      <p class="gifting-banner__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
      <h2 class="gifting-banner__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.settings.text != blank -%}
      <div class="gifting-banner__text rte">{{ section.settings.text }}</div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if gifting_collection != blank and gifting_collection.products_count > 0 -%}
      <gifting-scroller class="gifting-banner__scroller">
      <ul class="gifting-banner__products" aria-label="Featured gifts" data-gift-track>
        {%- for product in gifting_collection.products limit: product_count -%}
          <li class="gifting-banner__product">
            <a class="gifting-banner__product-link" href="{{ product.url }}">
              <span class="gifting-banner__product-image-wrap">
                {%- if product.featured_image != blank -%}
                  <img
                    class="gifting-banner__product-image"
                    src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 700 }}"
                    srcset="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 350 }} 350w, {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 700 }} 700w"
                    sizes="(max-width: 989px) 45vw, 16vw"
                    alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                    width="700"
                    height="574"
                  >
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>
              <span class="gifting-banner__product-title">{{ product.title | escape }}</span>
              {%- if section.settings.show_price -%}
                <span class="gifting-banner__product-price">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </a>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>

      {%- comment -%}
        The controls hide themselves when every product already fits, so a
        collection of three gifts looks exactly as it did before the row could
        scroll. The script sets the hidden attribute; nothing here assumes it.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if section.settings.show_arrows or section.settings.show_progress -%}
      <div class="gifting-banner__controls">
        {%- if section.settings.show_progress -%}
          <div class="gifting-banner__progress" aria-hidden="true" data-gift-progress>
            <span class="gifting-banner__progress-bar" data-gift-bar></span>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.show_arrows -%}
          <div class="gifting-banner__arrows" data-gift-arrows>
            <button type="button" class="gifting-banner__arrow gifting-banner__arrow--prev" aria-label="Previous gifts" disabled>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M15 4 7 12l8 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="square"/>
              </svg>
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="gifting-banner__arrow gifting-banner__arrow--next" aria-label="More gifts">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M9 4l8 8-8 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="square"/>
              </svg>
            </button>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      {%- endif -%}
      </gifting-scroller>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if button_label != blank and button_link != blank -%}
      <a class="gifting-banner__button" href="{{ button_link }}">{{ button_label | escape }}</a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{%- style -%}
  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} {
    --gift-section-bg: #ffffff;
    --gift-heading-color: #171310;
    --gift-eyebrow-color: #6c6259;
    --gift-text-color: #3f3932;
    --gift-card-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    --gift-card-color: #171310;
    --gift-button-fill: transparent;
    --gift-button-ink: #171310;
    --gift-button-edge: #171310;
    --gift-button-fill-hover: #171310;
    --gift-button-ink-hover: #ffffff;
    --gift-heading-size: clamp(25px, 2.5vw, 40px);
    --gift-heading-size-mobile: clamp(22px, 6vw, 30px);
    --gift-heading-tracking: 0.045em;
    --gift-heading-case: uppercase;
    --gift-eyebrow-size: 11px;
    --gift-text-size: clamp(13px, 1.05vw, 15px);
    --gift-card-text-size: 12px;
    --gift-measure: 42ch;
    --gift-band-height: clamp(300px, 33.3vw, 620px);
    --gift-content-share: 42%;
    --gift-focal-x: 0%;
    --gift-focal-y: 50%;
    --gift-scrim: 0;
    --gift-visible: 3;
    --gift-visible-mobile: 2;
    --gift-card-gap: clamp(10px, 1.1vw, 18px);
    --gift-pad-top: 54px;
    --gift-pad-bottom: 54px;
    --gift-pad-top-mobile: 22px;
    --gift-pad-bottom-mobile: 28px;
    --gift-pad-inline-mobile: clamp(16px, 3vw, 28px);

    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    /* The band is held off the glass by --gift-inset ("Side spacing"), which is 0
       until it is set, so the width has to come off with it or the row overflows. */
    width: calc(100% - var(--gift-inset, 0px) * 2);
    min-height: var(--gift-band-height);
    margin-block: 0 !important;
    margin-inline: var(--gift-inset, 0px);
    padding: var(--gift-pad-top) clamp(28px, 6vw, 96px) var(--gift-pad-bottom);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--gift-section-bg);
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }}.eden-quote--content-left { justify-content: flex-start; }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__media {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -2;
    inset: 0;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__media picture {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__background {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: var(--gift-focal-x) var(--gift-focal-y);
  }

  /*
    A wash under the content only, for a photograph whose empty half is busier than this one's.
    It is transparent at 0, which is the default, so it costs nothing until it is asked for.
  */
  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }}::after {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to left,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, var(--gift-scrim)) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, var(--gift-scrim)) 30%,
      transparent 72%
    );
    content: '';
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }}.eden-quote--content-left::after { transform: scaleX(-1); }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__content {
    display: flex;
    width: clamp(300px, var(--gift-content-share), 100%);
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    text-align: left;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }}.eden-quote--center .gifting-banner__content {
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--gift-eyebrow-color);
    font-family: var(--font-body--family, sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--gift-eyebrow-size);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__heading {
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--gift-heading-color);
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family, Georgia, serif);
    font-size: var(--gift-heading-size);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: var(--gift-heading-tracking);
    text-transform: var(--gift-heading-case);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__text {
    max-width: var(--gift-measure);
    margin-top: 14px;
    color: var(--gift-text-color);
    font-family: var(--font-body--family, sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--gift-text-size);
    line-height: 1.65;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__text > :first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__text > :last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__scroller {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: clamp(18px, 2.2vw, 30px);
  }

  /*
    A scrolling row rather than a fixed grid.

    grid-auto-flow: column with a fixed auto-column means the cards keep the
    width "Products shown at once" gives them and the rest of the collection
    runs off the right-hand edge of the panel, where the arrows and a swipe
    both reach it. A template-columns grid would have divided the panel
    between every product instead, and six gifts in a panel this narrow would
    be thumbnails.
  */
  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__products {
    display: grid;
    width: 100%;
    grid-auto-flow: column;
    grid-auto-columns: calc(
      (100% - (var(--gift-visible) - 1) * var(--gift-card-gap)) / var(--gift-visible)
    );
    gap: var(--gift-card-gap);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    overflow-x: auto;
    overscroll-behavior-x: contain;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }

  /* The row is driven by the arrows and by swiping; the bar below says where it
     has got to, so the browser's own scrollbar is not needed under the cards. */
  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__products::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__product {
    min-width: 0;
    background: var(--gift-card-bg);
    color: var(--gift-card-color);
    text-align: center;
    scroll-snap-align: start;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__controls {
    display: flex;
    width: 100%;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  /* The script hides the whole row when there is nothing to scroll to; the
     flex above would otherwise win over the hidden attribute. */
  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__controls:empty,
  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__controls[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__progress {
    position: relative;
    height: 1px;
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    max-width: 220px;
    background: var(--gift-text-color);
    opacity: 0.22;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__progress-bar {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: var(--gift-text-color);
    transform: scaleX(0);
    transform-origin: left center;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__arrows {
    display: flex;
    margin-left: auto;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__arrows[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  /* Bare chevrons, the same pair the tennis row uses: there is nothing behind
     them here for a white disc to lift them off. */
  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__arrow {
    display: grid;
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    color: var(--gift-text-color);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__arrow svg {
    width: 62%;
    height: 62%;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__arrow:hover:not(:disabled) {
    transform: scale(1.12);
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__arrow:disabled {
    opacity: 0.25;
    cursor: default;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__arrow:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid currentcolor;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__product-link {
    display: block;
    padding: 10px 10px 12px;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__product-link:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid currentcolor;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__product-image-wrap {
    display: grid;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 0.82;
    place-items: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #fff;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__product-image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    transition: transform 0.5s var(--cta-sweep-easing, ease);
  }

  @media (hover: hover) {
    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__product-link:hover .gifting-banner__product-image {
      transform: scale(1.04);
    }
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__product-title {
    display: -webkit-box;
    min-height: 2.6em;
    margin: 10px 0 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-family: var(--font-body--family, sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--gift-card-text-size);
    line-height: 1.3;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__product-price {
    display: block;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body--family, sans-serif);
    font-size: var(--gift-card-text-size);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  /*
    The paint and the hover both come from assets/eden-actions.css, which names
    .gifting-banner__button in the one call-to-action family. This only says which two
    colours the shared sweep crosses between.
  */
  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__button {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-width: 190px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: clamp(18px, 2vw, 26px);
    padding: 12px 28px;
    border-width: 1px;
    border-style: solid;
    font-family: var(--font-body--family, sans-serif);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    --cta-fill: var(--gift-button-fill);
    --cta-ink: var(--gift-button-ink);
    --cta-edge: var(--gift-button-edge);
    --cta-fill-hover: var(--gift-button-fill-hover);
    --cta-ink-hover: var(--gift-button-ink-hover);
    --cta-edge-hover: var(--gift-button-fill-hover);
  }

  /*
    Where the button sits under the row.

    The panel is a left-aligned column, so the button used to hang off the
    left edge under three cards that fill the width - it read as an orphan
    rather than as the end of the panel. "Button alignment" moves it on its
    own, without disturbing the heading and the copy above it, which is why it
    is align-self here and not a change to the column's own alignment.
  */
  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }}.eden-quote--button-center .gifting-banner__button {
    align-self: center;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }}.eden-quote--button-right .gifting-banner__button {
    align-self: flex-end;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }}.eden-quote--button-left .gifting-banner__button {
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} + .section { margin-block-start: 0 !important; }

  /*
    Just above the stacking width the panel has to give ground: the photograph's subject takes
    the same share of the frame however wide the screen is, so a panel held at its full width
    starts to sit over the rings. It takes its own width back above 1365px.
  */
  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) and (max-width: 1365px) {
    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} {
      padding-right: clamp(20px, 3.5vw, 44px);

      /*
        The crop grows with the band, and the band grows with the panel, so deep spacing here
        zooms the photograph until the rings reach under the cards. The spacing is capped
        rather than replaced, so a tighter setting is still honoured.
      */
      padding-top: min(var(--gift-pad-top), 24px);
      padding-bottom: min(var(--gift-pad-bottom), 24px);
    }

    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__content {
      width: clamp(280px, calc(var(--gift-content-share) - 4%), 100%);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} {
      display: block;
      min-height: 0;
      width: calc(100% - var(--gift-inset-mobile, 0px) * 2);
      margin-inline: var(--gift-inset-mobile, 0px);
      padding: 0 var(--gift-pad-inline-mobile) var(--gift-pad-bottom-mobile);
    }

    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__media {
      position: relative;
      inset: auto;
      width: calc(100% + (2 * var(--gift-pad-inline-mobile)));
      margin-inline: calc(var(--gift-pad-inline-mobile) * -1);
    }

    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__background {
      height: auto;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }}::after { content: none; }

    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__content {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 820px;
      align-items: center;
      margin-inline: auto;
      padding-top: var(--gift-pad-top-mobile);
      text-align: center;
    }

    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__text { max-width: 52ch; }
  }

  /*
    A tablet gets the stacked shape above but keeps the desktop row of cards and the desktop
    type: "products per row on mobile" is for a phone, where three cards across would be
    thumbnails.
  */
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__heading { font-size: var(--gift-heading-size-mobile); }
    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__eyebrow { margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 9px; }
    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__text { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 13px; }

    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__scroller { margin-top: 16px; }

    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__products {
      --gift-card-gap: 10px;
      grid-auto-columns: calc(
        (100% - (var(--gift-visible-mobile) - 1) * var(--gift-card-gap)) / var(--gift-visible-mobile)
      );
    }

    /* A phone scrolls the row with a finger, so the arrows are a pair of
       targets in the way of the swipe rather than a help. The bar stays: it is
       the only thing saying there is more of the row to come. */
    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__arrows { display: none; }

    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__controls {
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__progress { flex: 0 1 160px; }

    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__product-link { padding: 8px; }
    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__product-title,
    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__product-price { font-size: 11px; }
    #eden-quote-{{ section.id }} .gifting-banner__button { width: 100%; margin-top: 18px; }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Gifting banner",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Picture"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image",
      "label": "Desktop image",
      "info": "Leave empty to use the shop's own gifting photograph. A shot with its subject on one side and clear space on the other works best."
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "mobile_image",
      "label": "Mobile image",
      "info": "Leave empty to use the desktop picture, or the theme's own cropped gifting photograph when no desktop picture is set."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "focal_x",
      "label": "Focal point across",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "focal_y",
      "label": "Focal point down",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 50
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "scrim_opacity",
      "label": "Wash behind the text",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 0,
      "info": "Lightens the photograph under the panel when the text is hard to read."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Small heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Find the perfect gift"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "uppercase_heading",
      "label": "Heading in capitals",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text",
      "label": "Text"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "Products to feature"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "product_count",
      "label": "Products in the row",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 12,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 6,
      "info": "How many products the row holds altogether. Anything past the number shown at once scrolls, with arrows under the cards on a computer and a swipe on a phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "columns",
      "label": "Products shown at once",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 4,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 3,
      "info": "How many cards are on screen before the row scrolls. The panel is narrow, so more than three turns the cards into thumbnails."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "columns_mobile",
      "label": "Products shown at once on mobile",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 3,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_arrows",
      "label": "Show the arrows",
      "default": true,
      "info": "The pair under the cards that moves the row on. They hide themselves when every product already fits, and a phone scrolls with a finger instead."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_progress",
      "label": "Show the scroll progress bar",
      "default": true,
      "info": "The line under the cards that fills as the row scrolls. It hides itself when there is nothing to scroll to."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_price",
      "label": "Show prices",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "button_label",
      "label": "Button label",
      "default": "Shop gifts"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "button_link",
      "label": "Button link",
      "info": "Leave empty to link to the featured collection."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "content_side",
      "label": "Content side",
      "options": [
        { "value": "right", "label": "Right" },
        { "value": "left", "label": "Left" }
      ],
      "default": "right"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "text_alignment",
      "label": "Text alignment",
      "options": [
        { "value": "left", "label": "Left" },
        { "value": "center", "label": "Centred" }
      ],
      "default": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "button_alignment",
      "label": "Button alignment",
      "info": "Where the button sits under the row of gifts. It moves on its own, so the heading and the copy above it stay where they are. Everything centres on a phone whatever is chosen here.",
      "options": [
        { "value": "left", "label": "Left" },
        { "value": "center", "label": "Centred" },
        { "value": "right", "label": "Right" }
      ],
      "default": "center"
    },
    {
